  m_Name: Rock 6
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  line: 'We believe the eggs should be returned to their nest, atop the great mountain.
    In our centuries we have learned that dragons are only hostile when provoked.
    All life can live in harmony. '
  option1:
    text: Tell the people of Helver, they are terrified.
    next: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9dc4e38888a3e7341960c06d76e97894, type: 2}
    action: 0
  option2:
    text: No. many people have told me the dragon needs to die.
